{"specId": "504452b7-575d-4919-aefb-2411ef029e88", "workflowType": "fast-task", "specType": "feature", "archived": true, "archivedReason": "Contradicts and partly superseded by shipped behaviour. Malformed messages are left undeleted for DLQ redrive (shipped field malformed_received), not deleted/discarded as the spec states (malformed_discarded). The run tier (drain_queue/RunSummary/MAX_BATCHES_PER_RUN/terminal_reason) was superseded by the long-lived run_forever/RunTotals worker in src/ingestion_pipeline/runner.py (see archived queue-drain-runner spec). The batch tier (BatchResult/BatchSummary/run_batch(batch_number)) did ship as described. See archive banners in requirements.md, design.md, tasks.md and the steering docs."}
